<title>AUSTRALIA: CRICKET-PAKISTAN 223 ALL OUT V AUSTRALIA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-PAKISTAN 223 ALL OUT V AUSTRALIA.</headline>
<dateline>ADELAIDE, Australia 1996-12-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan scored 223 all out in 49.5 overs in a World Series limited-overs match against Australia at Adelaide Oval on Sunday.</p>
<p>Score - Pakistan 223 all out in 49.5 overs (Aamir Sohail 67) v Australia.</p>
